			"notes": "### New Blocks and Items\n\n* Added new machine: **Air Collector**: Features a capacity of 10,000 FE and an 8-bucket tank. It consumes 30 FE/t and collects 5 mB of air per tick.\n* Added new machine: **Liquid Cooler**: Features an energy buffer of 10,000 FE, consumes 35 FE/tick, and has two 10-bucket fluid tanks.\n* Added **Raw Uranium**, as well as a **Fan** and a **Heat Exchanger** as crafting components.\n\n### New liquid\n* New liquid added - **liquefied air** (obtained by cooling air in a liquid cooler). Needed for producing nitrogen and oxygen.\n\n### Changes and Fixes\n\n* Fixed machine configuration, fluid tank, and the rectification column render.\n* Optimized Electrolyzer functionality and its crafting recipe.\n* Changed machine configuration rendering in the code.\n* Changed Electrolyzer texture rendering in JEI.\n* Finally fixed machine configuration.\n* The Electrolyzer no longer accepts the Speed Upgrade, and shift+click support has been added to it.\n* Changed root package name from \"com.kirsan122.assembly_expansion\" to \"kirsan122.assemblyexpansion\".\n* Moved classes from the \"kirsan122.assemblyexpansion.core.registry\" package to \"kirsan122.assemblyexpansion.common.init\", except for the AETags class, which was moved to \"kirsan122.assemblyexpansion.common.util\".\n* Marked the GuiConfigHelper class as 'Deprecated'."
